Package: uzunyx-keys
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Recommends: uzunyx-shortcuts
Description: Window listing the shortcuts of the Uzunyx desktop
 Opens with Super+Space, from the menu, or from the Uzunyx module of System
 Settings, and shows each shortcut with the keys it has right now.
